      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.82,
      "end_seconds": 7.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.31,
      "text": "Hmm, hi, doctor, I came as soon as they called me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.74,
      "end_seconds": 13.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "yes, come in and sit down what brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.91,
      "end_seconds": 20.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "I wanted to get headaches in the evenings at home looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.02,
      "end_seconds": 23.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.83,
      "end_seconds": 34.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Sit still for a a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.0,
      "end_seconds": 54.85,
      "duration_seconds": 6.85,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 98 percent, temperature 36.7, pulse 78. And pressure 111 over 73."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.39,
      "end_seconds": 69.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.45,
      "end_seconds": 73.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "For two months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.55,
      "end_seconds": 77.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Does anything help it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.95,
      "end_seconds": 82.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "I get some relief from going outside"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.24,
      "end_seconds": 87.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.7,
      "end_seconds": 94.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "maybe a seven out of ten on a bad day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.33,
      "end_seconds": 95.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "hm, okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.94,
      "end_seconds": 107.61,
      "duration_seconds": 10.67,
      "text": "And nausea, too. As for nausea, maybe a three out of ten on a bad day. It happens on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.33,
      "end_seconds": 111.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "so, any cough, fever or sore throat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.48,
      "end_seconds": 114.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.08,
      "end_seconds": 118.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Have you had any rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.32,
      "end_seconds": 121.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "not at all, no rash"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.76,
      "end_seconds": 125.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.73,
      "end_seconds": 132.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.78,
      "end_seconds": 136.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.43,
      "end_seconds": 142.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, no, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.65,
      "end_seconds": 146.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.26,
      "end_seconds": 154.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "Sorry, uh, what was I saying, not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.74,
      "end_seconds": 156.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.62,
      "end_seconds": 160.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.6,
      "end_seconds": 163.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.06,
      "end_seconds": 169.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.75,
      "end_seconds": 188.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.52,
      "end_seconds": 193.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "No, uh, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.56,
      "end_seconds": 197.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.7,
      "end_seconds": 200.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "look straight ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.7,
      "end_seconds": 216.6,
      "duration_seconds": 6.9,
      "text": "your oxygen reading looks normal and the examination is normal, but I'm worried about the pattern"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.42,
      "end_seconds": 220.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "That's the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.31,
      "end_seconds": 249.03,
      "duration_seconds": 10.72,
      "text": "taking everything into account, I don't have a clear answer today: possible carbon monoxide exposure at home is possible, and so is a viral illness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.44,
      "end_seconds": 252.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.55,
      "end_seconds": 263.03,
      "duration_seconds": 9.48,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now possible carbon monoxide exposure at home is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.96,
      "end_seconds": 278.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "I'm going to order a carboxyhaemoglobin blood test, for possible carbon monoxide exposure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 280.81,
      "end_seconds": 283.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "the earliest is Wednesday, 10 am"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.17,
      "end_seconds": 288.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Wednesday, that works for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.73,
      "end_seconds": 304.99,
      "duration_seconds": 15.26,
      "text": "Please don't use the boiler tonight and get it checked by an engineer, and keep a window open. Let's get you seen by the gas emergency service, I'll arrange the letter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.47,
      "end_seconds": 309.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.52,
      "end_seconds": 314.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "I'll want another look tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.69,
      "end_seconds": 319.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "I'll note it it in my calendar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.01,
      "end_seconds": 324.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.28,
      "end_seconds": 330.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
